{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：20:15 2026-11-23 HKT<br/>發佈時間：20:15 2026-11-23 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：20:15 2026-11-23 HKT</p><p>韓星邊佑錫、容祖兒、何超蓮及王丹妮等今日到尖沙咀出席品牌專門店開幕活動，雖然現場下着微微雨，但仍有近千名粉絲到場圍觀，由於一直下着雨關係，大會取消了邊佑錫的答問環節，邊佑錫只閃現近分半鐘，在佈景板前影完相就離開，而期間邊佑錫亦識做地派心派飛吻和揮手。</p><img alt=\"韓星邊佑錫黑色裝束現身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4dee3cd5105b281579f964f6dbab712c/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_25_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"和觀眾揮手打招呼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/e6941a332aec4087cc6cd77606c592bc/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_25_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"派心心冧粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9f7cd56108f09a864133cd08457a3d3f/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_26_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"型仔登場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f168fd742d811943f99d3682f01e2379/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_28_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"加送親切笑容。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/9d18edee753cc46b103d5ef2043f4917/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_28.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"表現親民。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a8200ebb1ec92a7e56c080d4078ca3a5/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_29.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"邊佑錫只閃現近分半鐘。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6e2204f966d91db1b368ee0c6fbe09e1/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_49_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"在佈景板前影完相就離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/ab2134c679b79eccafa25dbf88da8d43/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_49.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"好快閃人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/437d0a8891cbe1093d026115dff2fa49/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_50.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"現場有近千名粉絲到場圍觀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6015ce8d2443d618a0ad7d04b580f971/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-23_at_18_03_25.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"王丹妮出席活動。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/72577b7e2d8b34e5bfd8f76c6807730e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-1